Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 06:22:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] feat(14-05): implement PrometheusAction resolver (.cc +
 GN target + tests)

- Add prometheus_action.cc with GetPrometheusActionIconMap() (72-entry flat_map
  via base::NoDestructor) and GetPrometheusActionSvgPath() switch statement
- Add prometheus_action_unittest.cc: 3 tests verifying map size = 72, every
  action maps to a non-null VectorIcon, every action maps to a .svg path (D-08)
- Wire prometheus_action source_set in chrome/browser/prometheus/BUILD.gn
  depending on :prometheus_vector_icons; add :prometheus_action dep to test
- Fix prometheus_unittests: remove duplicate prometheus_color_mixer.cc source
  that caused duplicate symbol with //chrome/browser/ui/color:mixers dep
- Add prometheus-specific vector_icons.cc.template and vector_icons.h.template
  to avoid -Wunused-const-variable and wrong-module header inclusion
- All 3 PrometheusActionTest tests pass; all 6 verify-asset-pipeline assertions pass
- Satisfies DESIGN-04, D-08
